										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color has-huge-font-size wp-elements-15"><strong>周りを気にせず、ゆったり競輪観戦を楽しもう！</strong></h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">9月1日（火）から期間限定で、4階ロイヤルルームに『特別個室席』を設置し、ロイヤルルームをご利用の方に開放しております。<br>周囲を気にすることなく、自分だけの空間で競輪に集中し、ゆったりとお楽しみいただけます。</p>



<div style="height:22px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="731" src="https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14490-1024x731.jpeg" alt="" class="wp-image-47157" srcset="https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14490-1024x731.jpeg 1024w, https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14490-300x214.jpeg 300w, https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14490-768x548.jpeg 768w, https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14490-1536x1096.jpeg 1536w, https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14490.jpeg 1600w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>



<div style="height:22px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div style="height:22px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="724" src="https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14488-1-1024x724.jpeg" alt="" class="wp-image-47167" srcset="https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14488-1-1024x724.jpeg 1024w, https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14488-1-300x212.jpeg 300w, https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14488-1-767x542.jpeg 767w, https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14488-1-1536x1086.jpeg 1536w, https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14488-1.jpeg 1600w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>



<div style="height:22px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color has-huge-font-size wp-elements-16"><strong>「特別個室席」とは</strong>？</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">「ゆっくり予想に集中したい」、「周囲を気にせずレースを楽しみたい」、「落ち着いた場所で競輪を観戦したい」そんな要望にお応えしたちょっと贅沢な席となっています！<br>ぜひこの機会に、いつもとはひと味違う、贅沢な競輪観戦をお楽しみください。<br><br></p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="769" src="https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PXL_20260901_054320623-2-1024x769.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-47162" srcset="https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PXL_20260901_054320623-2-1024x769.jpg 1024w, https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PXL_20260901_054320623-2-300x225.jpg 300w, https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PXL_20260901_054320623-2-767x576.jpg 767w, https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PXL_20260901_054320623-2-1536x1153.jpg 1536w, https://nagoyakeirin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PXL_20260901_054320623-2-2048x1538.jpg 2048w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>



<div style="height:22px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">完全な個室ではなく、パーティションで区切った空間です。</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">貴重品の取り扱いには、十分ご注意ください。</p><p>The post <a href="https://nagoyakeirin.com/47129/">4Fロイヤルルームに「個室席」が登場！</a> first appeared on <a href="https://nagoyakeirin.com">【公式】名古屋けいりん - 愛知県名古屋市の競輪場</a>.</p>]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
